STRUCTURE: ( Visible Part )

METHOD /Path?key=value&key&value&key=value

EG : GET /search?q=python&page=2&sort=price

     path = /search
     query parameters: q=python&page=2&sort=price


HTTP REQUEST : ( visible + invisible )

HTTP Request
│
├── Request Line
│     ├── Method (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE...)
│     ├── Path (/users)
│     └── Query Parameters (?page=2)
│
├── Headers
│     ├── Metadata
│     ├── Content-Type
│     ├── Content-Length
│     └── Authorization
│
├── Blank Line
│
└── Body (Payload)
      ├── Login credentials
      ├── Signup form
      ├── JSON
      ├── Images
      ├── PDFs
      ├── Videos
      └── Any data the client wants to send